 </strong></b><strong>3000/-\u00a0</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong>\u00a0You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">JEECUP UPJEE Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 July 2025</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age<strong> : 14 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidate Date of Birth for Admission 2025 Should be on or\u00a0<strong>Before 01/07/2011.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Check More Details For<strong> JEECUP UPJEE 2025 </strong>Visit<strong> Official Website.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">NA</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"736ead1a92fa4d6aeb67a